/-! # APM b98J04: a minimal faithful right ideal in a Wedderburn ring

## Statement repairs

None.  A right ideal of a possibly noncommutative ring is encoded honestly as
an `Rᵐᵒᵖ`-submodule of `R`; no commutativity assumption is introduced.
